{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他没再等一个不会伤到任何东西的办法，接着做眼前的事，久违的劲头又回来了。\",\n      \"key\": \"久违的劲头\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他尽力做好眼前能做的事，也不再逼自己非得把一切扭转过来。\",\n      \"key\": \"尽力做好\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他舍不得那种不必防备的生活，也知道眼前的事得做，怕顾住一头会伤到另一头。\",\n      \"key\": \"舍不得那种生活\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"text\": \"正因为舍不得自己真心爱惜的生活，他愿意把眼前的事担起来。\",\n      \"key\": \"真心爱惜\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道自己还会累，想到眼前的事可能伤到那种生活，担心又冒出来，他仍带着不安继续做。\",\n      \"key\": \"带着不安继续做\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"动摇\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R63\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"校正前因\",\n      \"why\": \"撤掉 S05-4→S12-4。放下证明自己坚强的旧动机，不能解释为何愿意承担；真正的前因是 S07-2：他知道光在心里想着那种生活，护不住珍惜的东西。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R64\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"校正前因\",\n      \"why\": \"撤掉 S05-4→S12-5。S07-3 解释他为何担心行动伤到珍惜的生活，S11-6 则解释为何担心再起，他仍选择继续。保留原条目文字，不丢掉他对疲惫的认识。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "81810a18-d030-48d8-b47a-ba5670af2e55", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T003347251414Z", "elapsed_seconds": 140.094, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:36:07.357738+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5d31a020d869ad10e00562c0e4d95f6e50fa0a6a119d2393debd40015833061e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T003347